#addProjectModal.modal.fade-in.show
  .modal-dialog
    .modal-content
      .modal-header
        h4.modal-title {{ heading ? heading : &apos;New Group&apos; }}
        button.close((click)='closeModal.emit()', type='button') &times;
      form([formGroup]='projectForm', (ngSubmit)='addProject(projectForm.value)')
        .modal-body.pb-0
            .form-group(*ngIf='subheading')
                p {{ subheading }}
            .form-group
                label(for='newProjectLabel') 
                    | Group Name
                    i.icon__tooltip(tooltipPosition="right", pTooltip="A group is a section of students on a reading", tooltipZIndex="9000")
                        span.icon.icon-circle.icon-info  i
                input#newProjectLabel(tabindex='0', type='text', placeholder='What will you call the group?', [formControl]="projectForm.controls['label']")
                #msgLabelRequired.alert.alert-warning(*ngIf="formSubmitted && projectForm.controls['label'].hasError('required')", role='alert')
                    b No Name
                    | Groups like to have names!
            div([class.hero-box]="!isHero")
                .form-group
                    label More with Hero
                    .row
                        p.col-9.small(*ngIf='!isHero')
                            | Unlock group instructions, the choice of comment types, and custom codes! 
                        .col-3.nopadding
                            a.btn.btn-sm.btn-hero([routerLink]='["/hero"]') Learn More
                .form-group([class.disabled]="!isHero")
                    label(for='groupInstructions')
                        | Reading Group Instructions
                    input#groupInstructions.form-control.form-item--editor.h3.mGroup([formControl]="projectForm.controls['groupInstructions']", type='text', placeholder="In today's mission, you will...")
                .form-group.row([class.disabled]='!isHero')
                    label.col-12 Comment Types
                    .input-group.col-6
                        label.custom-control.custom-checkbox
                            input.custom-control-input(type='checkbox', [formControl]="projectForm.controls['emojiType']")
                            span.custom-control-indicator
                            span.custom-control-description Emoji Commenting
                    .input-group.col-6
                        label.custom-control.custom-checkbox
                            input.custom-control-input(type='checkbox', [formControl]="projectForm.controls['textType']")
                            span.custom-control-indicator
                            span.custom-control-description Text Commenting
                    .input-group.col-6
                        label.custom-control.custom-checkbox
                            input.custom-control-input(type='checkbox', [formControl]="projectForm.controls['audioType']")
                            span.custom-control-indicator
                            span.custom-control-description
                            | Audio Commenting 
                            span.hero-tag(title='Hero Power') H
                    .input-group.col-6
                        label.custom-control.custom-checkbox
                            input.custom-control-input(type='checkbox', [formControl]="projectForm.controls['replyType']")
                            span.custom-control-indicator
                            span.custom-control-description
                            | Comment Replies 
                            span.hero-tag(title='Hero Power') H
                .form-group.pb-0([class.disabled]='!isHero')
                    label(for='customCodeInput')
                        | Custom Code
                    input#customCodeInput.form-control.form-item--editor.h3.mGroup([formControl]="projectForm.controls['customCode']", type='text', placeholder='(optional)', style='text-transform:lowercase;')
                    #errorInvalidCustomCode.alert.alert-warning(*ngIf='errors.invalidCode') Whoops, someone is already using that group code. Could you pick another?
        .modal-footer
            .button__row(style='padding-top:0px;')
                button#buttonCreateGroup.btn.btn-primary(tabindex='0', type='submit', [class.loading]='loading', name='Add Project', style='margin: 5px 3px; width:100%;') Create Group
            #msgServiceError.alert.alert-warning(*ngIf='formSubmitted && errors.serviceError', role='alert') Uh oh! We messed up and we don&apos;t know what to do!
